  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">LUANAR - Sustainable Food Systems  in Malawi (FOODMA) Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objectives of the FoodMa is to strengthen local food systems in selected Extension Planning Areas  in five districts of Malawi. Its goal is to contribute towards resilient sustainable food systems and it is expeced that the project will lead to improved food and nutrition security in addition to increasing income among the agriculture-dependent rural households in Malawi.</narrative>
  </description>
